            <ArticleTitle>Surgical treatment of intramyocardial foregut cysts.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>737-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Intramyocardial foregut cysts have been identified as incidental findings at autopsies, but there have been no reports of surgical management of clinically significant cysts. We report 2 patients and provide recommendations for appropriate management.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
